      "widgets_values": [
        "H3 + Video Director + MiniMax H3 Realism People LoRA\n\nWhat this workflow does:\n1. Uses Video Director for multi-clip timelines.\n2. Patches BOTH H3 checkpoints with h3-realism-people-t2v-i2v-r2v.safetensors at 1.0.\n3. Keeps H3 audio via minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors.\n\nModel notes:\n- Trigger word: r34l1sm\n- Suggested LoRA strength: 1.0 (lighter touch: 0.6–0.8)\n- FL2VA file: minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors\n- Ref2VA file: minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors\n- Text encoder type must be minimax.\n\nTimeline notes:\n- timeline_json starts as {}. Open the Video Director timeline editor in ComfyUI and add your clips, prompts, references, or source media there.\n- Keep r34l1sm in your global style or clip prompts whenever you want the realism LoRA effect.\n"
      ],
